---
// v2/src/components/pace/Testimonials.astro
---

<section id="field-team" class="py-24 sm:py-36 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <span class="eyebrow block mb-3 text-[#ff5a1f]">Field Tested</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl text-[#0c0e12] leading-[0.94] mb-6">
        Worn by people who measure everything.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5e6777] leading-relaxed">
        From sub-3 marathoners to high-altitude mountaineers, athletes choose PACE for pure biometric signal without digital noise.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[#f6f7f9] p-8 sm:p-10 border border-[#e2e5eb] flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-6">
            <img src="/images/pace/stock-cycling.jpg" alt="Elena Rostova, Ultra Cyclist" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="text-[#0c0e12] font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6 text-base sm:text-lg">
            “I spent four years disabling screen notifications on every smartwatch. PACE gives me back all the recovery and sleep depth data without adding another screen to my existence.”
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-base text-[#0c0e12]">Elena Rostova</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#5e6777] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Ultra-endurance Cyclist</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[#f6f7f9] p-8 sm:p-10 border border-[#e2e5eb] flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-6">
            <img src="/images/pace/stock-swim.jpg" alt="Marcus Vance, Open Water Swimmer" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="text-[#0c0e12] font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6 text-base sm:text-lg">
            “The battery longevity and waterproof rating are remarkable. I swim in the open Pacific ocean every dawn and only slip on the battery pack once a week.”
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-base text-[#0c0e12]">Marcus Vance</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#5e6777] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Open Water Triathlete</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[#f6f7f9] p-8 sm:p-10 border border-[#e2e5eb] flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-6">
            <img src="/images/pace/stock-trail.jpg" alt="Dr. Julian Becker" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="text-[#0c0e12] font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6 text-base sm:text-lg">
            “No recurring subscription is the breath of fresh air hardware desperately needed. I own my historical biomarker data and the heart rate variability tracks my lab ECG.”
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-base text-[#0c0e12]">Dr. Julian Becker</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#5e6777] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Sports Cardiologist & Runner</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
